# Copy this file to .env and fill in your key. .env is gitignored.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# NEVER put a real key in THIS file. It is tracked by git and will be published.
# The real value belongs only in .env, which is ignored.
#
# Never paste a key into a chat transcript or an issue either. If it has been
# somewhere it can be read, rotate it.

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
